<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Dataset Statistics and Licenses</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide the sample sizes and licenses of the datasets used in this work in <a href="#A3.T5" title="In Appendix C Dataset Statistics and Licenses ‣ Nudging the Boundaries of LLM Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Table</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>. All the datasets are in English and all datasets are used in a fashion consistent with their intended use.</p>
